# Build context for a standalone apps/web image.
#
# Note: the committed apps/web/Dockerfile is built from the repository root, because this
# directory is a pnpm workspace member and --frozen-lockfile needs the root lockfile and
# the sibling manifests. This file applies if you build with apps/web as the context
# instead, and is kept so a host node_modules can never enter an image by that route.

node_modules
.next
out
dist
build
coverage

*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts

.env
.env.*
*.local

Dockerfile
.dockerignore